investigations by regulatory inspectors. Applying this standard to artificial intelligence means that restricting hardware access is not an alternative to equity audits, but the physical prerequisite that makes enforcement possible. Without upstream capability ceilings, administrative penalties become merely a cost of doing business for developers who treat civil rights fines as routine overhead while pursuing unconstrained capability expansion.",
